# Project Context

## Login / Signup – Disabled for Now

**Login and signup features are currently disabled.** They will be implemented in the future.

- **Control**: `AUTH_DISABLED_FOR_NOW` in `lib/auth.ts` – set to `true` to disable auth app-wide
- **Behavior when disabled**:
  - `/login` and `/login/otp` redirect to home (or `returnTo` param)
  - Navigation hides Login button and Profile dropdown
  - Cart shows "Proceed to Book" without requiring login
  - Profile/My Bookings (`/profile/bookings`) redirects to home
- **To re-enable**: Set `AUTH_DISABLED_FOR_NOW = false` in `lib/auth.ts`
- **Related**: `NEXT_PUBLIC_DISABLE_AUTH` env var can also disable auth (for testing)

## Auth Flow (when re-enabled)

- OTP-based login: `/login` → send OTP → `/login/otp` → verify → set cookie
- APIs: `/api/auth/otp/send`, `/api/auth/otp/verify`, `/api/auth/logout`
- User session: JWT in cookie (`salon_auth`), `lib/auth-jwt.ts`

## WhatsApp Cloud API (direct, no BSP)

- **OTP**: `sendOtpWhatsApp()` in `lib/whatsapp-cloud.ts` – used by `/api/auth/otp/send` when `WHATSAPP_ACCESS_TOKEN` and `WHATSAPP_PHONE_NUMBER_ID` are set
- **Invoice**: `sendInvoiceWhatsApp()` – after payment (callback + webhook). Default template `customer_invoice`: IMAGE header URL (`WHATSAPP_INVOICE_HEADER_IMAGE_URL` or built-in default) + body vars + URL button; see `docs/WHATSAPP_INVOICE_UTILITY_TEMPLATE.md`. Legacy: `WHATSAPP_INVOICE_TEMPLATE_LEGACY=true`
- **Setup**: Meta Business Manager → App → WhatsApp → Phone Number ID + Access Token. Create OTP (Copy Code) and invoice templates; set names in `.env`
- **Testing without WhatsApp**: Set `LOG_OTP_WHEN_NO_WHATSAPP=true` – OTP is logged to server console. Invoice is simply not sent (payment still completes). Auth is disabled by default.
